(text "U9 limits BOOST INPUT current and latches OFF on overload; cycle input power to reset.\n12 V useful output: 300 mA shared. U7D senses rail voltage; U9 fault also pulls PG low.\n100nF soft start; 13k / 33nF compensation requires assembled-board loop and transient qualification." (at 15 272 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d9efa4a2-9980-5a1c-beaa-6675dc53fe9b"))
